# counter, so the Scientists stay 3/3 and the Lightning Bolt drawn stays in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
A.I.M. Scientists
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.A.I.M. Scientists.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.A.I.M. Scientists.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
